===Etymology===
{{compound|fr|ma|demoiselle}} Contraction of ''[[ma]] [[demoiselle]]'' {{gloss|my little lady}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA|madėmoiselle}}
* {{audio|Fr-mademoiselle.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
