# [[Miss]] (as a form of address)

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|f|demoiselles}}

# [[Miss]] (as a title with a name)

====Usage notes====
* Not used for an older woman unless she is clearly unmarried.
* As of February 21, 2012, the use of the word '''mademoiselle''' is prohibited from use in official forms and registries in France. ([http://www.nytimes.com/2012/02/23/world/europe/france-drops-mademoiselle-from-official-use.html "‘Mademoiselle’ Exits Official France"], [http://www.reuters.com/article/2012/02/23/us-france-mademoiselle-idUSTRE81M1DR20120223 "Mademoiselle is no longer an official French woman"])

